The standalone package removes application-specific model types, routing,
authentication, and business actions. It adds a general-purpose document compiler,
Markdown/HTML adapters, a React Native component, independent packaging and tests,
and an example application. The native module is registered as RichFlow;
interactive range decorations use the general-purpose decoration action name.

